---
import CaseSection
  from "../components/case-study/CaseSection.astro";

import CaseMedia
  from "../components/case-study/CaseMedia.astro";
---

<!-- =======================================================
     CONTEXT
     ======================================================= -->

<CaseSection
  number="01"
  label="Context"
  title="Rethinking an academic website with a large amount of information."
  intro="This section will eventually explain the project background, existing website, users, constraints, and what initiated the redesign."
>
  <p>
    The final version of this section will be written
    after we gather the complete project materials.
    For now, this text exists only to establish the
    reading width, rhythm, and hierarchy of the case
    study template.
  </p>
</CaseSection>


<!-- =======================================================
     BEFORE / RESEARCH MEDIA
     ======================================================= -->

<section class="site-container">
  <CaseMedia
    label="Existing website"
    caption="Placeholder — existing FMIPA website or initial design context."
    ratio="wide"
    tone="light"
  />
</section>


<!-- =======================================================
     DESIGN DIRECTION
     ======================================================= -->

<CaseSection
  number="02"
  label="Design Direction"
  title="Creating a clearer visual and information hierarchy."
>
  <p>
    This section can later contain information about
    navigation, layout decisions, typography,
    information architecture, and the visual direction
    developed for the redesign.
  </p>

  <p>
    We will only include processes that actually
    happened during the project rather than forcing
    the project into a generic design-thinking
    framework.
  </p>
</CaseSection>


<!-- =======================================================
     TWO VISUALS
     ======================================================= -->

<section
  class="site-container grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2"
>
  <CaseMedia
    label="Homepage"
    caption="Placeholder for one of the primary interface directions."
    ratio="portrait"
    tone="panel"
  />

  <CaseMedia
    label="Inner page"
    caption="Placeholder for departmental or information-page exploration."
    ratio="portrait"
    tone="dark"
  />
</section>


<!-- =======================================================
     IMPLEMENTATION
     ======================================================= -->

<CaseSection
  number="03"
  label="Implementation"
  title="Taking the design beyond Figma."
>
  <p>
    This section will document how approved designs
    were translated into the actual website and where
    implementation constraints influenced design
    decisions.
  </p>
</CaseSection>


<section class="site-container">
  <CaseMedia
    label="Final implementation"
    caption="Placeholder for implemented WordPress pages."
    ratio="wide"
    tone="green"
  />
</section>